      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. It verifies that two `MutableClock` instances sharing the same underlying `instantHolder` (created via `withZone`) but having the same zone produce identical hash codes. I'll improve understandability by removing unused imports, clarifying variable names, and adding a brief comment explaining the shared-updates concept.The improved test compiled successfully."
